Package: telecomplanrevenue
Title: Telecom Plan Revenue Data Lake Task
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Working environment for an end-to-end billing-revenue pipeline over a
    mobile carrier data lake. The analyst discovers the authoritative sources,
    reconciles usage grains and units, and reports billed plan revenue by tier.
Imports:
